          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>3 分</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E1B4B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>有引导或兜底之一，但错误路径未设计</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ height: 104, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1.5px solid #E5E7EB', borderRadius: 14, padding: 20, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 88, height: 56, background: '#F0FDF4', borderRadius: 10, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16A34A' }}>4–5 分</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E1B4B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>有引导 / 示例 / 默认值，错误有兜底且结果可溯源</Text>
